  <!-- Description -->
  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="Gun_ArchotechChargeRifle"]/description</xpath>
    <value>
      <description>A charge rifle upgraded with the power of Archotech, you cant even imagine how much power each shot has. It also glows with a mysterious force. \n\n(Like all Archotech weapons, it uses a vanometric reactor to create the projectiles, making it to require no physical ammo to shoot, but due to the lack of space, it is required to open the reactor holder in order to let it to cool down, so there is still some sort of reloading)</description>
    </value>
  </Operation>


  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
    <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="Gun_ArchotechChargeSMG"]/description</xpath>
    <value>
      <description>A charge SMG upgraded with the power of Archotech, Its very light making it really easy and fast to use, but it loses a lot of accuracy at longer range. It also glows with a mysterious force. \n\n(Like all Archotech weapons, it uses a vanometric reactor to create the projectiles, making it to require no physical ammo to shoot, but due to the lack of space, it is required to open the reactor holder in order to let it to cool down, so there is still some sort of reloading)</description>
    </value>
  </Operation>

