      <description>An Archotewch power charged revolver, it glows with mysterious power. \n\n(Like all Archotech weapons, it uses a vanometric reactor to create the projectiles, making it to require no physical ammo to shoot, but due to the lack of space, it is required to open the reactor holder in order to let it to cool down, so there is still some sort of reloading)</description>
    </value>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationReplace">
